// The sprites of the Adventure skin, cut out of UI Pack Pixel Adventure by Kenney
// (kenney.nl/assets/ui-pack-pixel-adventure, CC0) by Art/make_ui_packs.py, which is where to change anything in
// here, this file is written by it. The pack is a sheet of tiles sixteen pixels across (the small ones with the
// thick outline), the same things in wood and in steel side by side, and those two are the themes here, a layer
// of art.aseprite each. It has no button under the pointer or held down, those are the plain one made a little
// lighter and a little darker and lower, and no bar that lies down, the ones here are its upright ones turned.
//
// The names are the ones the components and the layouts ask for, which are Dead Revolver's, so a layout written
// for that skin comes up in this one. Where a face isn't the colour the skin writes on (the red and the blue of
// whatever is chosen) the sprite says so itself with a text_color.

